+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Added a "Storage conditions" field (plain text, up to 250 characters) to the product details form, so staff can set storage instructions (e.g. "Keep refrigerated at 2–8 °C") on a product. The field can also be translated on the product translations page and exported as a column in the product CSV export.
